    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the lovely countryside of Killard, 1.6kms from the quaint village of Turlough with amenities including Grocery store, local licensed premises and the historical Turlough House & Gardens. This delightful 2-bedroom detached cottage offers an unbeatable opportunity for those with a vision for transformation and a desire for rural living. The property is positioned on a site of 2300sqm(0.55acres) with outbuildings and awaits a buyer ready to embrace its wonderful potential. Surrounded by mature shrubbery and trees and located at the end of a quiet cul de sac, this property offers a peaceful calm of stillness and quiet.\r\n\r\nHouse…4.87m x 12.4m (16ft x 41ft) \r\nLean to kitchenette/bath 1.5m x5.8m  (5ft x 19ft).\r\n\r\nSite area 41m frontage x 49.5m\r\n\r\nThis property is a project requiring extensive works and renovation but a blank canvas for a buyer that can transform into a warm retreat.\r\nA property’s potential is always about looking ahead. Current opportunities, including the Vacant Property Grant and energy upgrade assistance from Sustainable Energy Ireland, provide added incentives to make this place something truly special.\r\n\r\nExternally the property has the benefit of large stone sheds."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Central livingroom with two bedrooms located off the livingroom. There is a lean to extension to rear which offers kitchenette & separate bathroom.\r\nThe property requires extensive renovation but meets all the criteria for the Vacant Homes Grant."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: Exempt"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Continue into village of Turlough from old Castlebar Turlough Rd, turn left at Turlough stores, continue on until next left which leads to Parke.\r\nPass Turlough Round Tower and after the Tower take the next left continue to end of the cul de sac house is on left hand side."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment with Sole Selling Agent Claire Flannelly ...notice is required for all viewings."
      }
    ],
